  "question": {
    "text": "The pressure applied from all directions on a cube is <math><mi>p</mi><mo>.</mo></math> How much its temperature should be raised to maintain the original volume? The volume elasticity of the cube is <math><mi>β</mi></math> and the coefficient of volume expansion is <math><mi>α</mi><mo>.</mo></math>"
